# @name getProfile
GET {{host}}/user/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

###
# @name updateProfile
PUT {{host}}/user/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
  "username": "Gabriel Atualizado",
  "email": "gabriel.atualizado@gmail.com"
}

###
# @name changePassword
PATCH {{host}}/user/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "654321"
}

###
# @name deleteProfile
DELETE {{host}}/user/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
